# --- Generated outputs --------------------------------------------------------
# reports/promotions.md is committed on purpose (PLAN.md §8): the promotion decisions
# are part of the deliverable. Everything else in reports/ is regenerable.
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep
!reports/promotions.md
# Row-count reconciliation is evidence that the load is complete, and a cloner cannot
# regenerate it without the (non-committable) dataset. It contains counts, not data.
!reports/raw_load_reconciliation.md
!reports/etl_funnel.md
!reports/as_of_snapshots.md
!reports/feature_matrix.md
!reports/phase4_models.md
*.png
!docs/**/*.png

